  Best Options to Get Real Data

  1. Public Records Request (Recommended)
    - Submit via https://washoecountynv.nextrequest.com/
    - Request: "All summary eviction filings from Reno Justice Court and Sparks Justice Court for 2023-2025, including case number, filing date, address, plaintiff, defendant, and disposition"
    - Cost: $0.50/page + $6 certification
  2. Contact Court Statistics Directly
    - Email: statistics@nvcourts.nv.gov
    - Phone: (702) 486-9333
    - Ask for Washoe County Justice Court eviction filings by fiscal year
  3. Manual Court Search (labor-intensive)
    - Register at https://justicecourts.washoecourty.gov/OnlineServices
    - Search case-by-case (no bulk export)
  4. Accela Code Violations (labor-intensive)
    - Search by address or date range
    - Export results manually

